{"unit_id":"bamboostrip__dsh-llm-capabilities#feature-1","repo":"bamboostrip/dsh-llm-capabilities","commit":"537efa64f0794c0221bdb1d9ffdad7bdb194d1b2","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-llm-capabilities 的功能「reasoning」：检测并配置模型推理档位：从服务商模型列表和模型目录识别 reasoning 支持，用户可按模型开关档位并编辑发往网关的名称。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/shared/detection.ts:67-103"]}
